@startuml 协同过滤推荐时序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 体育场馆管理系统 - 协同过滤推荐时序图

actor "会员" as Member
participant "前端Vue" as Front
participant "KechengxinxiController" as Controller
participant "StoreupService" as SUService
participant "UserBasedCollaborative\nFiltering" as CF
participant "KechengxinxiService" as KCService
participant "MySQL" as DB

Member -> Front: 1. 查看推荐课程
Front -> Controller: 2. GET /kechengxinxi/autoSort2
activate Controller

Controller -> SUService: 3. 查询所有用户收藏
activate SUService
SUService -> DB: 4. SELECT * FROM storeup
activate DB
DB --> SUService: 5. 收藏列表
deactivate DB
SUService --> Controller: 6. List<StoreupEntity>
deactivate SUService

Controller -> CF: 7. new CF(userRatings)
activate CF
CF -> CF: 8. 构建物品-用户倒排表
CF -> CF: 9. 构建用户稀疏矩阵
deactivate CF

Controller -> CF: 10. recommendItems(user, num)
activate CF
CF -> CF: 11. 计算余弦相似度
note right of CF
  sim(u1,u2) = |I(u1)∩I(u2)| / √(|I(u1)|×|I(u2)|)
end note
CF -> CF: 12. 选择Top-K相似用户
CF -> CF: 13. 获取推荐物品ID
CF --> Controller: 14. 推荐ID列表
deactivate CF

Controller -> KCService: 15. 查询推荐课程详情
activate KCService
KCService -> DB: 16. SELECT * FROM kechengxinxi
activate DB
DB --> KCService: 17. 课程列表
deactivate DB
KCService --> Controller: 18. List<KechengxinxiEntity>
deactivate KCService

Controller --> Front: 19. 推荐课程数据
deactivate Controller
Front --> Member: 20. 显示推荐课程

@enduml
